name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"uyfOQql0ZGMG4WEIwUeeEQ","review_id":"uQxDDZXZFrldpbyygxJD4w","date":"2019-05-05T15:17:05","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9493389129638672,"text_excerpt":"The new spot is amazing. My wife made a reservation here for dinner with friends and I was surprised at how good everything was. I had never heard of the place until then but I certainly will never forget it now. We all sampled a few of the drinks. The top shelf margarita was excellent however I have to say that once we sampled the frozen blackberry margarita it became everyone at the tables favorite, let's just say I'm glad we took an Uber! The salsa sampler was a unique twist which we all enjoyed. The chicken tinga tacos honestly were the best chicken tinga I've ever tried in my life and those of you who know me know that Mexican food is my favorite so let's just say I've had my fair sh..."},{"business_id":"uyfOQql0ZGMG4WEIwUeeEQ","review_id":"Q4MFayn9Y1I6QCGZUX_byg","date":"2019-06-11T18:17:28","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9479279518127441,"text_excerpt":"So I am loving Nolé and the vibe it has. I attended an event here and had to go back to check the food out and yes it was still amazing. Celebrating birthdays during happy hour turned out to be a very good choice. 4-7 is more than enough time to celebrate. The food was delicious. I enjoyed the quesadilla and the bread pudding and I was a happy girl. the guacamole is a must order. Enjoyed it both times I have been here. It's really filling and so worth the $$. White sangria, tequila and rum chatta shots to bring in a new chapter. Staff was friendly and took great care of us. Definitely a hangout place for us with good food and great drinks"},{"business_id":"uyfOQql0ZGMG4WEIwUeeEQ","review_id":"RdVDg4MWu1fgZgbDskSqVQ","date":"2019-05-16T11:15:51","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9469473958015442,"text_excerpt":"I went here for happy hour on Wednesday and the food was great. I had two cocktails. One was a mojito and the other was a red sangria. Both cocktails were very delicious. The mojito was refreshing, perfect for a summer day. The sangria wasn't overpowered with sugar, like many sangria as I've tried and I liked that. I also tried the bbq shrimp, which was pretty spicy, but just enough spice and flavor to my liking. It was cooked perfectly and was a nice size. The street corn with blue crab was so rich with flavor because of the cream. The blue crab added a nice touch to the corn. I would definitely recommend going. Also don't forget to try a horchata shot!!"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"uyfOQql0ZGMG4WEIwUeeEQ","photo_id":"JqL-4PxjUSF-Ss586hCr5Q","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/JqL-4PxjUSF-Ss586hCr5Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.892155647277832},{"business_id":"uyfOQql0ZGMG4WEIwUeeEQ","photo_id":"DrwHfVpNUfgTl9z601N51Q","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/DrwHfVpNUfgTl9z601N51Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8735764026641846},{"business_id":"uyfOQql0ZGMG4WEIwUeeEQ","photo_id":"LHkQtfEf7BSZxjB50KkmyA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/LHkQtfEf7BSZxjB50KkmyA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8645810484886169},{"business_id":"uyfOQql0Z